  "mentions": [
    {
      "bookId": "soushenji",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "entryId": "soushenji-01-13",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "汉明帝时，尚书郎河东王乔，为邺令。乔有神术，每月朔，尝"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 5,
      "entryId": "chuci-05-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "\n\n轩辕不可攀援兮,\n\n吾将从王乔而娱戏。\n\n餐六气而饮沆瀣兮,"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 9,
      "entryId": "chuci-09-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "。\n\n乃至少原之野兮,\n\n赤松王乔皆在旁。\n\n二子拥瑟而调均兮,"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 13,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-13-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "可爱也，而欧冶之巧可贵也。今夫王乔、赤诵子，吹呕呼吸，吐故纳新，"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 23,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-23-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "哉，方指所言而取一概焉尔。\n\n王乔、赤松去尘埃之间，离群慝之纷，"
    }
  ],
  "firstSeen": {
    "bookId": "soushenji",
    "chapterIndex": 1
  }
}
